        <mxCell id="x" value='xslt:&lt;br&gt;"int" becomes&lt;br&gt;"long"' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="330" y="100" width="130" height="80" as="geometry"/>
